## 2. Shopify 3-Tier Clean-Room Porting Architecture

Shopify SaaS cannot execute arbitrary server-side PHP. The architecture maps into three decoupled tiers:

```
[ Tier 1: Storefront (Native Theme & App Extension) ]
  ├── Native Theme: `sections/dnk-vton-floating-dock.liquid` (Floating launcher + Drawer)
  ├── PDP App Block: `blocks/dnk-vton-button.liquid` (CTA "Try on me" + Slot detector)
  ├── Universal App Extension: `apps/shopify/theme-extensions/dnk-app-blocks/blocks/dnk-vton.liquid`
  └── WebComponent / JS: Canvas image compressor + LocalStorage + `/cart/add.js`
            │
            ▼ (Shopify App Proxy / REST API: `/api/v1/shopify/vton/*`)
[ Tier 2: Backend Switchboard (FastAPI in DNK Core) ]
  ├── SHA-256 Multi-Item Combo Cache (Memory + Disk/KV)
  ├── Rate Limiter (IP / Customer ID / Shop session)
  └── Multi-Garment Prompt Builder (Identity Freeze + Slot Hierarchy)
            │
            ▼ (HTTPS REST / Gradio Client)
[ Tier 3: VTON Inference Engine ]
  ├── Kolors VTON (`Kwai-Kolors/Kolors-Virtual-Try-On` via Gradio Client)
  ├── Specialized VTON: FASHN.ai / IDM-VTON / CatVTON
  └── General Multimodal: OpenRouter (Gemini / Claude / FLUX)
```

