## 3. Storefront Implementation Contracts

### A. Liquid Theme Component (`blocks/dnk-vton-button.liquid`)
```liquid
{% comment %} blocks/dnk-vton-button.liquid {% endcomment %}
{% assign slot = product.metafields.custom.vton_slot | default: 'upper' %}
<button 
  type="button" 
  class="dnk-vton-btn" 
  data-dnk-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
  data-dnk-variant-id="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"
  data-dnk-title="{{ product.title | escape }}"
  data-dnk-image="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1024 }}"
  data-dnk-slot="{{ slot }}">
  <span class="dnk-vton-icon">👗</span>
  <span class="dnk-vton-label">{{ block.settings.button_label | default: 'Приміряти образ' }}</span>
</button>
```

### B. Multi-Item Cart Submission (`/cart/add.js`)
When user approves the assembled outfit in the drawer:
```javascript
async function addFullOutfitToCart(slots) {
  const items = slots
    .filter(slot => slot.variantId)
    .map(slot => ({
      id: Number(slot.variantId),
      quantity: 1,
      properties: { '_dnk_vton_outfit_id': outfitHash }
    }));

  const res = await fetch('/cart/add.js', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({ items })
  });
  return await res.json();
}
```

