## 4. Key Pitfalls & Hardening Rules
1. **Never Expose Merchant API Keys**: Storefront JS must NEVER call OpenRouter / Fal.ai directly. All inference requests must pass through `/api/v1/shopify/vton/*`.
2. **Mobile Canvas Memory Quota**: iOS Safari crashes if downscaling 48MP mobile photos on large canvases. Enforce maximum canvas dimension clamp to 1024x1024 before drawing.
3. **Out-of-Stock Variants**: Always re-verify live Shopify variant availability via `/products/{handle}.js` before submitting generation or cart payload.
4. **Clean-Room CI Assertion**: Ensure automated test asserts that no foreign developer handle or external author tag exists in production assets.
